hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2125","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''sach bolo, isliye ke sach neki ki taraf rehnumai karta hai aur neki jannat ki taraf rehnumai karti hai, aadmi hamesha sach boltaa hai aur sach ki talash mein rehta hai, yahan tak ke wo Allah key nazdik sachcha likh diya jata hai, aur jhoot sey bacho, isliye ke jhoot gunah ki taraf rehnumai karta hai aur gunah jahannam mein ley jata hai, aadmi hamesha jhoot boltaa hai aur jhoot ki talash mein rehta hai yahan tak ke Allah key nazdik jhoota likh diya jata hai.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein abu-Bakar Siddiq , umr , Abdullah bin Shikhkhir aur ibne-Umar (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2126","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab banda jhoot boltaa hai to us jhoot ki badboo ki wajeh sey farishta us sey eik mail door bhaagtaa hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. Yahya bin Musa kehtey hain : mainey Abdur-Raheem bin Harun sey puchha : kya aap sey Abdul-Azeez bin Abi Dawud ney ye hadees bayan ki? kaha : haan. 2- hum isey sirf isi tareeq sey jantey hain, iski riwayat karney mein Abdur-Raheem bin Harun munfarid (bilkul alag) hain."
"2127","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key nazdik jhoot sey badh kar koi aur aadat nafrat key qabil naa-pasandida nahin thi, aur jab koi aadmi Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas jhoot boltaa to wo hamesha aap ki nazar mein qabile-nafrat rehta yahan tak ke aap jaan letey ke usney jhoot sey tauba kar li hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan hai."
"2128","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jis chiz mein bhi behayaae aati hai usey aeb daar kar deti hai aur jis chiz mein hayaa aati hai usey zeenat bakhshti hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, hum isey sirf Abdur-Razzaaq ki riwayat sey jantey hain. 2- is bab mein Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"2129","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''tum mein sab sey behtar wo log hain jo akhlaq mein behtar hain, Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam behayaa aur bad-zabaan nahin they.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2130","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''tum log (kisi par) Allah ki lanat na bhejo, na uskey ghazab ki lanat bhejo aur na jahannam ki lanat bhejo.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein ibne-Abbas , Abu-Hurera , ibne-Umar aur Imran bin Husain (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2131","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''momin taana deney wala , lanat karney wala , behayaa aur bad-zabaan nahin hota hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- ye hadees Abdullah sey dusri sanad sey bhi aai hai."
"2132","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key samney eik aadmi ney hawa par lanat bheji to aap ney farmaya : ''hawa par lanat na bhejo isliye ke wo to ( Allah key ( hukm ki paband hai, aur jis shakhs ney kisi aisi chiz par lanat bheji jo lanat ki mustahiq nahin hai to lanat usi par lot aati hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- Bishr bin umr key ilawa hum kisi ko nahin jantey jisney isey marfooan bayan kiya hai."
